OL,3,GNEWSASir Tom Jones cancels another US
OL,4,Ashow after 'bad case of the flu'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Tom Jones said he is "truly sorry"
OL,7,Fafter rescheduling three forthcoming
OL,8,Fconcerts due to "a bad case of the
OL,9,Fflu".
OL,11,FThe 86-year-old singer from Pontypridd,
OL,12,FRhondda Cynon Taf, is currently on his
OL,13,FCome Gather Round world tour.
OL,15,FHe announced the decision to push back
OL,16,Fhis Monday show in Los Angeles, and
OL,17,FTuesday's concert in San Diego,
OL,18,Ffollowing doctor's advice.
OL,20,FOn Thursday, he said he had to
OL,21,Freschedule Friday's concert in
OL,22,FCalifornia as well.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
